# The first eight terms of OEIS A343507, each searched from scratch: prints n and a(n).
# About 10 seconds with `trawl fast`. The README's demo clip is this run, in real time.
use a343507
1 dup . 0 3000000000 search . 10 emit
2 dup . 0 3000000000 search . 10 emit
3 dup . 0 3000000000 search . 10 emit
4 dup . 0 3000000000 search . 10 emit
5 dup . 0 3000000000 search . 10 emit
6 dup . 0 3000000000 search . 10 emit
7 dup . 0 3000000000 search . 10 emit
8 dup . 0 3000000000 search . 10 emit
